    private fun story2() = EnStory(
        storyId = "adv_the_stranger_en",
        chapters = listOf(
            EnChapter(1, "The Death of Maman", listOf(
                "Maman died today, or yesterday maybe, and I don't know, and I received a telegram from the home saying that your mother has passed away, and the funeral will be tomorrow, and this tells me nothing.",
                "I do not know whether she died today or yesterday, and the telegram does not say, and it does not matter to me, and I do not understand why the telegram did not give a date.",
                "I took the bus to Marengo, where the home was, and it was hot, and I fell asleep, and when I woke up, I was there, and the caretaker met me, and he took me to see the body.",
                "The body was in a room, and the room was bright, and the walls were white, and the coffin was closed, and I did not want to see my mother, and I did not want to look inside the coffin.",
                "The caretaker asked me if I wanted to see her, and I said no, and he did not insist, and I sat in the room with the body, and I drank coffee, and I smoked cigarettes.",
                "I watched the people who came to visit, and some of them prayed, and some of them wept, and some of them said nothing, and I did not feel anything, and I did not cry.",
                "The vigil went on through the night, and I was tired, and I was bored, and I did not feel anything, and I did not want to cry, and I did not understand why everyone expected me to cry.",
                "I did not understand why everyone was making such a fuss about the death of an old woman who had lived her life and who had died, and I did not see that there was anything unusual about that.",
                "In the morning, we went to the church, and the priest spoke, and the priest said things about my mother, and I did not listen, and I did not care.",
                "I did not believe what the priest was saying, and I did not believe anything about it, and I just wanted the whole thing to be over.",
                "We went to the cemetery, and the sun was hot, and the ground was dry, and the coffin was lowered into the grave, and I watched, and I did not cry, and I did not feel anything.",
                "And I went home, and I was glad that it was over, and the next day was Saturday, and I went swimming.",
                "And I met a girl there, and her name was Marie, and she was young, and she was pretty, and she liked me, and I liked her, and we spent the day together.",
                "And I forgot about my mother, and I forgot about the funeral, and I lived in the moment, and the moment was all that mattered.",
                "That evening, I went to a movie, and the movie was a comedy, and I laughed, and Marie laughed, and we had a good time.",
                "And I did not feel that there was anything wrong with laughing on the day after my mother's funeral, and I did not understand why anyone would feel that there was.",
                "And so the first days after Maman's death passed, and I did not feel that I was mourning, and I did not feel that I was supposed to be mourning.",
                "And I did not feel that anything had really changed, and the world went on, and the sun went on shining, and the people went on living, and I went on living with them.",
                "For I am a man who lives in the present, and I do not look back, and I do not look forward, and I do not feel the things that other people feel.",
                "And I do not know why they feel them, and I do not know what it means to feel them, and I do not know whether feeling them would be better than not feeling them.",
                "And I do not know anything, and I do not think that knowing would change anything.",
                "And so I went on with my life, and my life was ordinary, and my life was small, and my life was in Algiers.",
                "And my life was as a clerk in a shipping office, and my life was as a man who had no ambition, and no future, and no past, and no meaning.",
                "And yet my life was my life, and it was the only life I had, and I did not want to lose it.",
                "And so Maman died, and I did not weep, and the world went on, and I went on with the world.",
                "And no one knew what I was thinking, and no one knew what I was feeling, and no one knew that I was not feeling anything.",
                "And no one knew that the man they saw was not the man I was, and no one knew that I was a stranger to myself.",
                "And no one knew that I was also a stranger to the world, and no one knew that the world was a stranger to me.",
